1
00:00:00,660 --> 00:00:02,070
(Penny:)You're right.
Penny jogs.

2
00:00:02,070 --> 00:00:03,630
(Howard(after Raj whispers to him):)Maybe you guys
can run together.

3
00:00:03,630 --> 00:00:05,990
(Sheldon:)That's an excellent idea.

4
00:00:08,510 --> 00:00:09,750
(Sheldon:)Yeah, if we chat,

5
00:00:09,750 --> 00:00:11,980
(Sheldon:)it will create the illusion
of time going faster.

6
00:00:11,980 --> 00:00:13,990
(Penny:)No, it won't.

7
00:00:15,040 --> 00:00:17,170
(Penny:)Um, how does he know I jog?

8
00:00:17,170 --> 00:00:21,490
(Howard:)Oh, he watches you from his car
with high-powered binoculars.

9
00:00:21,490 --> 00:00:23,350
(Penny:)Oh, my God, that is so creepy!

10
00:00:23,350 --> 00:00:25,010
(Howard:)I know!

11
00:00:28,380 --> 00:00:30,720
(Howard:)And he says he's
not gonna stop.

12
00:00:33,610 --> 00:00:37,360
(Howard:)Then see a shrink
and figure out how
to talk to women.

13
00:00:48,400 --> 00:00:50,490
(Leonard:)What the hell?

14
00:00:53,540 --> 00:00:54,830
(Leonard:)What's the matter?

15
00:00:54,830 --> 00:00:57,860
(Sheldon:)I have pain radiating
from my navel

16
00:00:57,860 --> 00:00:59,680
(Sheldon:)to my lower right abdomen.

